S Astrogeology Science Center has generated and delivered a High-Resolution Imaging Science Experiment (HiRISE) digital terrain model (DTM) mosaic and orthomosaic that is the basemap onto which surface hazards were mapped. The hazard map will be onboard the spacecraft and used by TRN to help identify the final, hazard-free landing location.", "catalog_uuid": "ad8d2800-e66e-4f4b-9a85-d377164d3a4e", "declared_crs": "urn:ogc:def:crs:EPSG::104905", "product_created_at": "2020-08-03T22:48:28Z"}}	01030000208C7E0E0001000000050000008A6C3189444E5340B36ECD678A4E3240A5828AAA5F655340B36ECD678A4E3240A5828AAA5F655340E5B8533A58AB32408A6C3189444E5340E5B8533A58AB32408A6C3189444E5340B36ECD678A4E3240
